WEBVTT

00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:16,240
Could you provide some information on dietary and supplements or gout management?

00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:25,200
Well, gout and gouty arthritis is an inflammatory arthritis is what that is.

00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:37,920
And it's usually flared by a diet that may be high in purines.

00:00:39,680 --> 00:00:48,080
So you could google high purine foods or you probably could google a gout friendly diet or gout

00:00:48,960 --> 00:00:59,280
natural gout diet, but foods that have a lot of purines foods that are sugary alcohol is the

00:00:59,280 --> 00:01:06,480
worst thing for gout. I don't see a lot of people with gout when I practiced years ago I used to

00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:11,040
see a number of people with gout and there are always people that were beer drinkers.

00:01:11,040 --> 00:01:19,360
So it was very difficult to get them a stop drinking beer because usually people that are chronic

00:01:19,360 --> 00:01:25,440
beer drinkers are you know alcoholics cause and alcoholics that can't stop drinking that.

00:01:26,320 --> 00:01:33,760
But other foods can cause it too so you can be you know a non alcoholic consumer but you might be

00:01:33,760 --> 00:01:45,040
addicted to sugar. That is a big driver of gout. Foods that have high purines are like organ

00:01:45,040 --> 00:01:52,480
meats, red meat which is so good for cancer patients especially if you have anemia so it's tough if

00:01:52,480 --> 00:01:58,240
you have cancer anemia and you're trying to eat more red meat to build up your red blood cells but

00:01:58,240 --> 00:02:08,800
you also have gout. So that's that's a difficult thing. As far as supplements that historically have

00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:21,200
been good for gout cherry juice and there's capsules of tart cherry capsules that a person could take

00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:30,000
you can drink tart cherry juice it's very it's very tart by its very name but that has helped people

00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:42,160
with gout lemon juice with water could help people with gout coffee could even help with gout so but

00:02:44,400 --> 00:02:50,080
and then just you know making sure you're following the seven phases of detox because a lot of people

00:02:50,080 --> 00:02:57,840
with gout tend to be constipated have issues with detoxing so even though you know they're not

00:02:57,840 --> 00:03:03,360
drinking alcohol they're not drinking eating a ton of hearing foods and things there's not detoxing

00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:08,160
very well so they give those kind of things

